{
 "item": "e55",
 "show": "dbza",
 "youtube": "bjHYQ-XFzEg",
 "title": "Episode 49",
 "duration": 568,
 "lines": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "start": 25.14,
   "end": 32.84,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "'So I'm a hair's breadth from perfection, and then *Triclops* shows up and decides: \"I'm just gonna turn triangles into f**kin' squares!\"'"
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "start": 33.08,
   "end": 38.46,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "'Then *Goku* shows up; apparently he can *teleport*! Gotta look into THAT later!'"
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "start": 38.62,
   "end": 42.64,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "'But at the very top of this long list of stupid questions, is:'"
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "start": 42.64,
   "end": 46.46,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "WHERE! ARE! YOU! EIGHTEEN...?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "start": 48.42,
   "end": 51.82,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 18",
   "text": "We got lucky. With all these islands, it'll be tough for him to find us."
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "start": 51.96,
   "end": 54.08,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 16",
   "text": "Technically, it's an archipelago."
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "start": 54.44,
   "end": 57.22,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 16",
   "text": "\"Noun; A *group* of islands.\""
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "start": 57.22,
   "end": 58.32,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 18",
   "text": "Thank you, Sixteen."
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "start": 58.32,
   "end": 59.54,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 16",
   "text": "You are welcome."
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "start": 59.86,
   "end": 62.12,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 18",
   "text": "Well, we could sneak away if we could get underwater."
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "start": 62.44,
   "end": 64.12,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 18",
   "text": "Sixteen, are you waterproof?"
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "start": 64.12,
   "end": 64.9,
   "kind": "sfx",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "BZZZT"
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "start": 64.9,
   "end": 65.88,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 16",
   "text": "I was."
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "start": 66.04,
   "end": 66.58,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 18",
   "text": "Shit."
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "start": 67.02,
   "end": 69.44,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 18",
   "text": "Then all we can do is wait and hope he just moves on."
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "start": 69.74,
   "end": 72.36,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "Do you understand what we could be together!?"
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "start": 72.76,
   "end": 74.8,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "We could be perfect!"
  },
  {
   "i": 17,
   "start": 74.8,
   "end": 82.1,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Tom",
   "text": "Dude! I know you're having issues with your girl... trust me, I get it, but you're makin' a scene, man!"
  },
  {
   "i": 18,
   "start": 82.32,
   "end": 84.4,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "Can I help you, uhhh...?"
  },
  {
   "i": 19,
   "start": 84.4,
   "end": 85.46,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Tom",
   "text": "My name's Tom!"
  },
  {
   "i": 20,
   "start": 85.56,
   "end": 92.24,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "Oh, well hi, Tom! I'll try to make less of a scene while I liquefy your insides and *proceed to drink you*!"
  },
  {
   "i": 21,
   "start": 92.24,
   "end": 94.82,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Tom",
   "text": "Hey! No need to be hostile, man!"
  },
  {
   "i": 22,
   "start": 94.82,
   "end": 98.4,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Sally",
   "text": "Do you people mind!? My child is trying to nap!"
  },
  {
   "i": 23,
   "start": 98.4,
   "end": 102.14,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Tom",
   "text": "I'm just trying to help this guy out with his lady problems."
  },
  {
   "i": 24,
   "start": 102.14,
   "end": 104.32,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "I don't need your help, Tom!"
  },
  {
   "i": 25,
   "start": 104.46,
   "end": 105.84,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "But, *thank you*...?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 26,
   "start": 105.84,
   "end": 106.56,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Baby begins to cry"
  },
  {
   "i": 27,
   "start": 105.84,
   "end": 106.56,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "Rerrgh...!"
  },
  {
   "i": 28,
   "start": 106.96,
   "end": 108.42,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Sally",
   "text": "Well, now you've done it!"
  },
  {
   "i": 29,
   "start": 132.98,
   "end": 133.52,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Korin",
   "text": "Hm?"
  },
  {
   "i": 30,
   "start": 135.36,
   "end": 136.64,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Korin",
   "text": "Oh, it's Bulma!"
  },
  {
   "i": 31,
   "start": 137.22,
   "end": 143.06,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Korin",
   "text": "Hey, Bulma! Did you bring back Yajiro-- OOOOFFfff course you didn't!"
  },
  {
   "i": 32,
   "start": 143.94,
   "end": 145.1,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Korin",
   "text": "Guhhooooh..."
  },
  {
   "i": 33,
   "start": 145.92,
   "end": 148.16,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Korin",
   "text": "I miss my Bean Daddy..."
  },
  {
   "i": 34,
   "start": 149.08,
   "end": 151.08,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bulma",
   "text": "Huh. So it does just kinda float there."
  },
  {
   "i": 35,
   "start": 151.08,
   "end": 157.9,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "*♪♪♪*"
  },
  {
   "i": 36,
   "start": 157.9,
   "end": 159.66,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bulma",
   "text": "Hey! Anyone here?"
  },
  {
   "i": 37,
   "start": 160.02,
   "end": 160.74,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "Bulma!"
  },
  {
   "i": 38,
   "start": 161.0,
   "end": 162.0,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Hey, Bulma!"
  },
  {
   "i": 39,
   "start": 162.44,
   "end": 163.32,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bulma",
   "text": "Hey, guys!"
  },
  {
   "i": 40,
   "start": 163.4,
   "end": 166.32,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Laughter"
  },
  {
   "i": 41,
   "start": 166.32,
   "end": 166.82,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bulma",
   "text": "Huh?"
  },
  {
   "i": 42,
   "start": 167.08,
   "end": 168.6,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bulma",
   "text": "Oh my gosh, Trunks!"
  },
  {
   "i": 43,
   "start": 168.82,
   "end": 171.6,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bulma",
   "text": "Your hair! It looks good..."
  },
  {
   "i": 44,
   "start": 171.92,
   "end": 173.2,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bulma",
   "text": "Eh-- platonically of course."
  },
  {
   "i": 45,
   "start": 173.48,
   "end": 178.4,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "It's okay, Mom. I literally just spent a year with Dad in the Time Chamber. I'm over it."
  },
  {
   "i": 46,
   "start": 178.48,
   "end": 181.36,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bulma",
   "text": "Wait - you spent an entire year with Vegeta!?"
  },
  {
   "i": 47,
   "start": 181.8,
   "end": 183.26,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bulma",
   "text": "Even I haven't managed that."
  },
  {
   "i": 48,
   "start": 183.46,
   "end": 186.34,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "Wouldn't recommend it. All he does is scream at you."
  },
  {
   "i": 49,
   "start": 186.6,
   "end": 187.64,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bulma",
   "text": "Yeah, he does."
  },
  {
   "i": 50,
   "start": 187.64,
   "end": 190.96,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bulma",
   "text": "Speaking of, how about you? Why didn't your hair grow?"
  },
  {
   "i": 51,
   "start": 190.96,
   "end": 196.02,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Because unlike a half-breed, a pure-blooded Saiyan's hair does not change from the day we are born."
  },
  {
   "i": 52,
   "start": 196.28,
   "end": 199.26,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "With the exceptions of beards, and moustaches."
  },
  {
   "i": 53,
   "start": 199.52,
   "end": 203.26,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Boy... now I can't stop thinkin' about Vegeta with a mustache."
  },
  {
   "i": 54,
   "start": 203.26,
   "end": 206.54,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Whimsically, with guitars playing in background"
  },
  {
   "i": 55,
   "start": 203.26,
   "end": 206.54,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "\"Moustaaaache.\""
  },
  {
   "i": 56,
   "start": 206.76,
   "end": 207.44,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Hee..."
  },
  {
   "i": 57,
   "start": 207.66,
   "end": 209.02,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bulma",
   "text": "Oh, before I forget..."
  },
  {
   "i": 58,
   "start": 209.1,
   "end": 209.6,
   "kind": "sfx",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "CLICK"
  },
  {
   "i": 59,
   "start": 212.18,
   "end": 213.2,
   "kind": "sfx",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "BAMF"
  },
  {
   "i": 60,
   "start": 213.42,
   "end": 216.22,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bulma",
   "text": "I brought you guys some armor for your fight against the Androids!"
  },
  {
   "i": 61,
   "start": 218.08,
   "end": 220.68,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "This is easily the greatest thing you've ever produced."
  },
  {
   "i": 62,
   "start": 220.68,
   "end": 221.96,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Baby Trunks",
   "text": "Gaoo, gaaaoou!"
  },
  {
   "i": 63,
   "start": 221.96,
   "end": 223.14,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Yes, even you!"
  },
  {
   "i": 64,
   "start": 223.32,
   "end": 224.26,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Baby Trunks",
   "text": "Aaaoouh."
  },
  {
   "i": 65,
   "start": 224.26,
   "end": 226.02,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bulma",
   "text": "Aren't you guys going to try them on too?"
  },
  {
   "i": 66,
   "start": 226.02,
   "end": 226.52,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Piccolo",
   "text": "No."
  },
  {
   "i": 67,
   "start": 226.52,
   "end": 227.02,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Tien",
   "text": "No."
  },
  {
   "i": 68,
   "start": 227.62,
   "end": 228.3,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bulma",
   "text": "Any reason?"
  },
  {
   "i": 69,
   "start": 228.3,
   "end": 228.8,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Piccolo",
   "text": "No."
  },
  {
   "i": 70,
   "start": 228.8,
   "end": 229.3,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Tien",
   "text": "No."
  },
  {
   "i": 71,
   "start": 230.06,
   "end": 232.12,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Hey look, Vegeta! I'm you!"
  },
  {
   "i": 72,
   "start": 232.3,
   "end": 234.12,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Paragon 'til death!"
  },
  {
   "i": 73,
   "start": 235.12,
   "end": 235.9,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "...You ruined it."
  },
  {
   "i": 74,
   "start": 236.26,
   "end": 237.74,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "You ruined it and I'm leaving."
  },
  {
   "i": 75,
   "start": 237.74,
   "end": 239.32,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "You want I should teleport you, buddy?"
  },
  {
   "i": 76,
   "start": 239.32,
   "end": 240.1,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "I hate you."
  },
  {
   "i": 77,
   "start": 240.18,
   "end": 242.22,
   "kind": "sfx",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "WOOSH"
  },
  {
   "i": 78,
   "start": 242.4,
   "end": 243.48,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "I should follow him."
  },
  {
   "i": 79,
   "start": 243.7,
   "end": 247.96,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Oh! Before you go... you'll probably want these... just in case."
  },
  {
   "i": 80,
   "start": 247.96,
   "end": 250.2,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "Thanks, but hopefully we won't need them."
  },
  {
   "i": 81,
   "start": 250.52,
   "end": 251.44,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Yeah, but..."
  },
  {
   "i": 82,
   "start": 251.88,
   "end": 252.72,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Vegeta."
  },
  {
   "i": 83,
   "start": 251.88,
   "end": 252.72,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "Father."
  },
  {
   "i": 84,
   "start": 253.08,
   "end": 256.88,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bulma",
   "text": "You should really hurry up. Said father has a head start on you."
  },
  {
   "i": 85,
   "start": 257.0,
   "end": 261.12,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "Yeah... and who knows what atrocities Cell is committing as we speak..."
  },
  {
   "i": 86,
   "start": 261.7,
   "end": 266.26,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Sally",
   "text": "My husband and I go to couple's counseling every Tuesday, and it's really helped us!"
  },
  {
   "i": 87,
   "start": 266.26,
   "end": 270.64,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "Yes, and I'm echappy to hear that, Sally; but my situation isn't exactly--"
  },
  {
   "i": 88,
   "start": 270.64,
   "end": 274.54,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Tom",
   "text": "Bro, if you love something, you have *got* to set it free!"
  },
  {
   "i": 89,
   "start": 274.54,
   "end": 276.18,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "Okay, that's- that's not--"
  },
  {
   "i": 90,
   "start": 276.18,
   "end": 279.06,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Richard",
   "text": "You can't be so clingy! It's kinda creepy."
  },
  {
   "i": 91,
   "start": 279.06,
   "end": 279.58,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "But it's--"
  },
  {
   "i": 92,
   "start": 279.58,
   "end": 281.78,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Sally",
   "text": "Do you think it's inadequacies in the bedroom?"
  },
  {
   "i": 93,
   "start": 282.0,
   "end": 283.16,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "'And we're done.'"
  },
  {
   "i": 94,
   "start": 283.16,
   "end": 285.98,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "EIGHTEEN! You have until the count of *five*!"
  },
  {
   "i": 95,
   "start": 286.28,
   "end": 292.06,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "Show yourself now, or I'm wiping out these islands one by one until I find you!"
  },
  {
   "i": 96,
   "start": 292.24,
   "end": 294.04,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Harry",
   "text": "Don't you think that's a little extreme?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 97,
   "start": 294.04,
   "end": 296.26,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "You're not involved in this anymore, Harry!"
  },
  {
   "i": 98,
   "start": 296.26,
   "end": 298.22,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Harry",
   "text": "I think I'm pretty involved!"
  },
  {
   "i": 99,
   "start": 298.46,
   "end": 299.46,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "FIVE!"
  },
  {
   "i": 100,
   "start": 299.6,
   "end": 301.44,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 18",
   "text": "This is bad. This is *really* bad!"
  },
  {
   "i": 101,
   "start": 301.44,
   "end": 301.94,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "FOUR!"
  },
  {
   "i": 102,
   "start": 301.94,
   "end": 302.8,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 16",
   "text": "Do not fret."
  },
  {
   "i": 103,
   "start": 303.16,
   "end": 304.34,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 16",
   "text": "You are too valuable."
  },
  {
   "i": 104,
   "start": 304.34,
   "end": 304.88,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "THREE!"
  },
  {
   "i": 105,
   "start": 304.88,
   "end": 306.78,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 16",
   "text": "He would not risk destroying you."
  },
  {
   "i": 106,
   "start": 306.78,
   "end": 307.28,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 18",
   "text": "And you're sure about that??"
  },
  {
   "i": 107,
   "start": 307.28,
   "end": 308.22,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "TWO!"
  },
  {
   "i": 108,
   "start": 308.42,
   "end": 309.36,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 16",
   "text": "Trust me."
  },
  {
   "i": 109,
   "start": 309.84,
   "end": 310.98,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "*ONE*."
  },
  {
   "i": 110,
   "start": 311.96,
   "end": 313.86,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Crowds screaming"
  },
  {
   "i": 111,
   "start": 311.96,
   "end": 313.86,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Richard",
   "text": "Can we please go back to TALKING ABOUT THIS?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 112,
   "start": 317.76,
   "end": 319.22,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 18",
   "text": "You were saying, exactly!?"
  },
  {
   "i": 113,
   "start": 320.28,
   "end": 321.96,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 16",
   "text": "This is a fluffy bird."
  },
  {
   "i": 114,
   "start": 323.1,
   "end": 324.84,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 18",
   "text": "Yeah. Guess that one's on me."
  },
  {
   "i": 115,
   "start": 325.68,
   "end": 327.52,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Mr. Popo",
   "text": "Alright! You maggots ready yet?"
  },
  {
   "i": 116,
   "start": 327.72,
   "end": 329.2,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Yup! Sorry for the wait."
  },
  {
   "i": 117,
   "start": 329.34,
   "end": 332.32,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "I can't believe you wasted half an hour on eating."
  },
  {
   "i": 118,
   "start": 332.32,
   "end": 333.84,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "There's food inside!"
  },
  {
   "i": 119,
   "start": 333.84,
   "end": 336.48,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Oh, come on, Gohan; what's half an hour?"
  },
  {
   "i": 120,
   "start": 336.84,
   "end": 338.2,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "7.6 days."
  },
  {
   "i": 121,
   "start": 338.2,
   "end": 340.0,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "(Gasp) But that's half a fortnight!"
  },
  {
   "i": 122,
   "start": 340.52,
   "end": 342.32,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Mr. Popo",
   "text": "Okay, I'm done with this. You get in."
  },
  {
   "i": 123,
   "start": 342.52,
   "end": 345.28,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "(Creaking)"
  },
  {
   "i": 124,
   "start": 352.5,
   "end": 354.18,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Welp! Here we are."
  },
  {
   "i": 125,
   "start": 354.56,
   "end": 357.64,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "You know... it's awfully nice of you to come join me, Gohan."
  },
  {
   "i": 126,
   "start": 357.9,
   "end": 361.96,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "I... never really had a choice. You basically kidnapped me."
  },
  {
   "i": 127,
   "start": 361.96,
   "end": 365.54,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Oh, come on, Gohan! You can't kidnap your own kid."
  },
  {
   "i": 128,
   "start": 365.84,
   "end": 368.88,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "I dunno if that's true. I'll have to read up on that."
  },
  {
   "i": 129,
   "start": 369.14,
   "end": 372.2,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Sorry Gohan, no books here! Or internet."
  },
  {
   "i": 130,
   "start": 372.62,
   "end": 376.06,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Only this room... and the void."
  },
  {
   "i": 131,
   "start": 376.06,
   "end": 378.26,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "\"Void\" echoes within the chamber"
  },
  {
   "i": 132,
   "start": 378.86,
   "end": 381.32,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "Uh... does it do that all the time?"
  },
  {
   "i": 133,
   "start": 381.32,
   "end": 384.98,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Oh, yeah. But only if you say the word \"void\"."
  },
  {
   "i": 134,
   "start": 384.98,
   "end": 386.98,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "\"Void\" echoes again"
  },
  {
   "i": 135,
   "start": 387.26,
   "end": 390.14,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "Okay, well, we're gonna avoid that word for now--"
  },
  {
   "i": 136,
   "start": 390.14,
   "end": 392.16,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "\"Void\" echoes once more"
  },
  {
   "i": 137,
   "start": 392.58,
   "end": 393.26,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "Why!?"
  },
  {
   "i": 138,
   "start": 393.76,
   "end": 397.92,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Alright, Gohan. First thing we're gonna do, is focus on getting you Super Saiyan!"
  },
  {
   "i": 139,
   "start": 398.2,
   "end": 401.42,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Now, it won't be easy, because Krillin's not here to die for you."
  },
  {
   "i": 140,
   "start": 401.82,
   "end": 407.32,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "But I think with some crunches, pull-ups, and plenty of milk... You'll find your way!"
  },
  {
   "i": 141,
   "start": 407.78,
   "end": 408.28,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "Oh..."
  },
  {
   "i": 142,
   "start": 408.8,
   "end": 410.98,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "Well, if you really believe in me--"
  },
  {
   "i": 143,
   "start": 411.16,
   "end": 412.48,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Also, we're gonna fight!"
  },
  {
   "i": 144,
   "start": 413.2,
   "end": 414.54,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "...A lot."
  },
  {
   "i": 145,
   "start": 415.42,
   "end": 416.58,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "...I need an adult."
  },
  {
   "i": 146,
   "start": 416.58,
   "end": 417.12,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "I am an adult--"
  },
  {
   "i": 147,
   "start": 417.12,
   "end": 418.88,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "No. No, you are not."
  },
  {
   "i": 148,
   "start": 424.88,
   "end": 427.9,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 18",
   "text": "Well... I'm pretty sure that was the last island..."
  },
  {
   "i": 149,
   "start": 428.18,
   "end": 429.84,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 18",
   "text": "Y'know, besides this one (!)"
  },
  {
   "i": 150,
   "start": 430.3,
   "end": 431.16,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 16",
   "text": "Island."
  },
  {
   "i": 151,
   "start": 431.54,
   "end": 432.28,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 16",
   "text": "\"Noun.\""
  },
  {
   "i": 152,
   "start": 432.94,
   "end": 433.66,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 16",
   "text": "Island."
  },
  {
   "i": 153,
   "start": 434.2,
   "end": 434.96,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 16",
   "text": "\"Noun.\""
  },
  {
   "i": 154,
   "start": 435.4,
   "end": 436.14,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 16",
   "text": "Island."
  },
  {
   "i": 155,
   "start": 436.14,
   "end": 436.72,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 18",
   "text": "We have got to get you fixed up, buddy."
  },
  {
   "i": 156,
   "start": 436.72,
   "end": 437.36,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 16",
   "text": "\"Noun.\""
  },
  {
   "i": 157,
   "start": 437.6,
   "end": 440.68,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 16",
   "text": "Have you tried turning me off, and on again?"
  },
  {
   "i": 158,
   "start": 441.4,
   "end": 443.22,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "'That's the last island.'"
  },
  {
   "i": 159,
   "start": 443.84,
   "end": 446.8,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "'She's either there... or I've killed her.'"
  },
  {
   "i": 160,
   "start": 447.9,
   "end": 448.9,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "Oh well, in for a penny."
  },
  {
   "i": 161,
   "start": 449.0,
   "end": 449.7,
   "kind": "sfx",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "BWOOP"
  },
  {
   "i": 162,
   "start": 450.74,
   "end": 451.24,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 18",
   "text": "Uhn!"
  },
  {
   "i": 163,
   "start": 451.32,
   "end": 453.22,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "(Laughing)"
  },
  {
   "i": 164,
   "start": 453.4,
   "end": 453.98,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "Uh!?"
  },
  {
   "i": 165,
   "start": 454.1,
   "end": 455.7,
   "kind": "sfx",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "WOOSH"
  },
  {
   "i": 166,
   "start": 456.48,
   "end": 458.76,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Ah, warming up by destroying some islands, huh?"
  },
  {
   "i": 167,
   "start": 459.14,
   "end": 462.08,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "I can dig that. More of a *planet* guy, myself."
  },
  {
   "i": 168,
   "start": 462.38,
   "end": 463.92,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "Ugh, people all day today."
  },
  {
   "i": 169,
   "start": 464.04,
   "end": 466.12,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "Hello, Vegeta."
  },
  {
   "i": 170,
   "start": 466.22,
   "end": 467.6,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Hello, *ugly*."
  },
  {
   "i": 171,
   "start": 467.9,
   "end": 469.78,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "Ugh... now we're doing this."
  },
  {
   "i": 172,
   "start": 469.78,
   "end": 470.4,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "Okay."
  },
  {
   "i": 173,
   "start": 470.82,
   "end": 473.12,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 18",
   "text": "Wait, is that... *Vegeta*!?"
  },
  {
   "i": 174,
   "start": 473.62,
   "end": 476.2,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 18",
   "text": "Well, bright side: we get to watch Vegeta bite it first."
  },
  {
   "i": 175,
   "start": 476.32,
   "end": 478.78,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Android 16",
   "text": "That bird has very sharp hair."
  },
  {
   "i": 176,
   "start": 479.96,
   "end": 481.74,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "So, can I help you?"
  },
  {
   "i": 177,
   "start": 481.74,
   "end": 486.0,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "'Cause if you're looking for another broken arm, you can always help me find Android 18."
  },
  {
   "i": 178,
   "start": 486.0,
   "end": 489.8,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "No, I just heard how ugly you were and I *had* to see it for myself."
  },
  {
   "i": 179,
   "start": 489.8,
   "end": 491.68,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "Also... I'm here."
  },
  {
   "i": 180,
   "start": 491.84,
   "end": 494.16,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "And that explains the bravado."
  },
  {
   "i": 181,
   "start": 494.36,
   "end": 495.9,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "You brought Junior!"
  },
  {
   "i": 182,
   "start": 495.9,
   "end": 498.86,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Nope! He's only here because he'd cry otherwise."
  },
  {
   "i": 183,
   "start": 499.24,
   "end": 501.02,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Because he's a *child*."
  },
  {
   "i": 184,
   "start": 501.72,
   "end": 502.88,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "...Also, you're ugly."
  },
  {
   "i": 185,
   "start": 502.88,
   "end": 503.44,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "Riveting."
  },
  {
   "i": 186,
   "start": 503.44,
   "end": 508.36,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "Listen, Vegeta, I'm in the middle of something more important than whatever \"this\" is."
  },
  {
   "i": 187,
   "start": 508.36,
   "end": 512.0,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "So if you just want to run along and bring back someone substantial, say..."
  },
  {
   "i": 188,
   "start": 512.38,
   "end": 513.32,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "I dunno..."
  },
  {
   "i": 189,
   "start": 513.52,
   "end": 514.16,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "Goku?"
  },
  {
   "i": 190,
   "start": 515.0,
   "end": 517.22,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "That'd be greeaaaaat."
  },
  {
   "i": 191,
   "start": 517.98,
   "end": 519.98,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "(Breathes deeply)"
  },
  {
   "i": 192,
   "start": 520.44,
   "end": 521.58,
   "kind": "sfx",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "BWOOSH"
  },
  {
   "i": 193,
   "start": 521.58,
   "end": 529.88,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "(Screaming)"
  },
  {
   "i": 194,
   "start": 524.44,
   "end": 528.12,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "Aw, what's wrong, Prince? Did I touch a *nerve*?"
  },
  {
   "i": 195,
   "start": 528.12,
   "end": 529.88,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "You pressed the Goku button."
  },
  {
   "i": 196,
   "start": 529.88,
   "end": 531.18,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "Excuse me, the what--"
  },
  {
   "i": 197,
   "start": 531.48,
   "end": 533.86,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Semi-Perfect Cell",
   "text": "(Groans in pain)"
  },
  {
   "i": 198,
   "start": 534.28,
   "end": 535.94,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Ya shouldn't'a did that."
  }
 ],
 "segments": [
  {
   "start": 24.6,
   "end": 47.0,
   "title": "Where Are You, Eighteen?!",
   "quote": "'But at the very top of this long list of stupid questions, is:' WHERE! ARE! YOU! EIGHTEEN...?!",
   "line_start": 0,
   "line_end": 3
  },
  {
   "start": 47.9,
   "end": 69.9,
   "title": "Technically, an Archipelago",
   "quote": "Technically, it's an archipelago. \"Noun; A *group* of islands.\" / Sixteen, are you waterproof? / I was. / Shit.",
   "line_start": 4,
   "line_end": 14
  },
  {
   "start": 69.3,
   "end": 94.8,
   "title": "We Could Be PERFECT",
   "quote": "Do you understand what we could be together!? We could be perfect! / Dude! I know you're having issues with your girl...",
   "line_start": 15,
   "line_end": 21
  },
  {
   "start": 199.0,
   "end": 207.9,
   "title": "Moustaaaache",
   "quote": "\"Moustaaaache.\"",
   "line_start": 53,
   "line_end": 56
  },
  {
   "start": 229.6,
   "end": 243.5,
   "title": "Paragon 'til Death",
   "quote": "Hey look, Vegeta! I'm you! Paragon 'til death! / ...You ruined it. You ruined it and I'm leaving.",
   "line_start": 71,
   "line_end": 78
  },
  {
   "start": 281.5,
   "end": 314.3,
   "title": "The Count of Five",
   "quote": "EIGHTEEN! You have until the count of *five*! ... *ONE*. / Can we please go back to TALKING ABOUT THIS?!",
   "line_start": 93,
   "line_end": 111
  },
  {
   "start": 328.9,
   "end": 340.5,
   "title": "Half a Fortnight",
   "quote": "What's half an hour? / 7.6 days. / (Gasp) But that's half a fortnight!",
   "line_start": 117,
   "line_end": 121
  },
  {
   "start": 368.7,
   "end": 393.8,
   "title": "The Void",
   "quote": "Only this room... and the void. / Uh... does it do that all the time?",
   "line_start": 129,
   "line_end": 137
  },
  {
   "start": 393.3,
   "end": 419.4,
   "title": "I Need an Adult",
   "quote": "It won't be easy, because Krillin's not here to die for you. / ...I need an adult. / I am an adult-- / No. No, you are not.",
   "line_start": 138,
   "line_end": 147
  },
  {
   "start": 424.4,
   "end": 441.2,
   "title": "Off and On Again",
   "quote": "Island. \"Noun.\" / We have got to get you fixed up, buddy. / Have you tried turning me off, and on again?",
   "line_start": 148,
   "line_end": 157
  },
  {
   "start": 456.0,
   "end": 479.3,
   "title": "More of a Planet Guy",
   "quote": "Warming up by destroying some islands, huh? I can dig that. More of a *planet* guy, myself. / Hello, *ugly*.",
   "line_start": 166,
   "line_end": 175
  },
  {
   "start": 503.0,
   "end": 536.4,
   "title": "The Goku Button",
   "quote": "Bring back someone substantial, say... I dunno... Goku? That'd be greeaaaaat. / You pressed the Goku button. / Ya shouldn't'a did that.",
   "line_start": 186,
   "line_end": 198
  }
 ]
}